This repository includes third-party material:

con_dec_imp_sim/assets/data/flying_gripper.usda
    Contains the visual and collision meshes and the link inertial parameters of
    the Franka Emika Panda hand and fingers from the `franka_description` package
    (version 0.7.1), Copyright Franka Emika GmbH, licensed under the
    Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
    The meshes are embedded unchanged; the kinematic structure (six virtual joints
    from the world to the hand) and the hand inertia were modified.
